text = "CONTROLS GUIDE
(Toggle this with F1)

MOVEMENT:
• Hold down right-click and move the mouse to angle your view.
• Move around laterally with W A S and D.
• Move up and down with SPACEBAR and C.
• Move view-relative up and down with E and Q.
• Speed up and slow down your movement with SHIFT and CTRL.

OTHER:
• Toggle debug info with F5.
• Cycle through chunk border styles with F6.
• Toggle fullscreen with F11 or ALT+ENTER.
• Quit game with ESCAPE."
